1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT === Preliminary info from Ancestry.com (Mika ===
2 CONT ≤p>Preliminary info from Ancestry.com (Mikael Fast family tree, which has demonstrable errors so these data must be verified).≤/p>
2 CONT ≤p>≤/p>
2 CONT ≤p>Possible death record on page 55 of the 1696-1716 Regna Kyrkobok C:2. It translates as "item Nils in Algustorp......70 years old". There is also a Jonas Olufsson from Algustorp, aged 70, on the same page. A brother?≤/p>
1 FAMC @F6000000227892148542@
1 FAMS @F6000000227892148539@
1 RFN geni:6000000227892148488
1 OBJE
2 FILE https://www.geni.com/images/documents/doc.png
2 FORM txt
2 TITL Death Nils Olofsson 1710-02-10
1 CHAN
2 DATE 23 SEP 2026
3 TIME 02:43:57
