2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT === From a Ancestry.com family tree with not ===
2 CONT ≤p>From a Ancestry.com family tree with notable errors. I am dubious about the name (Christina) and details (like 1727 death in Forshem parish, which I did not find). On the other hand, I didn't see any Regna death record between 
2 CONC 1726-28.....≤/p>
2 CONT ≤p>≤/p>
2 CONT ≤p>More plausible is a birth in Regna. Searching Regna christening records 1637-1652, there is ONE Kirstin daughter of Sven. Village/farm is Backa (which happens to be adjacent to Algustorp). Her christening record is on page 26 o
2 CONC f the 1637-1689 Ministerialbok C:1. Unfortunately, this Kirstin has a sister Lucia christened on March 11 1649, in Backa (page 34 of the same volume) which conflicts withtwins born to a different Sven in ALGUSTORP five months earl
2 CONC ier (top entry on page 34). This latter Sven appears to be the correct father (how many Sven's could there be in Algustorp in the 1640s?)
1 FAMC @F6000000227892148543@
1 FAMS @F6000000227892148539@
1 RFN geni:6000000227892148496
1 OBJE
2 FILE https://www.geni.com/images/documents/doc.png
2 FORM txt
2 TITL Death Kirstin Svensdotter 1736-12-28
1 CHAN
2 DATE 23 SEP 2026
3 TIME 02:43:57
