1 OCCU Bonde i Bureå
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Lundström, p. 396:
2 CONT "Herse Andersson is a farmer (bonde) on the farm 1543-1549. According to Johannes Bureus, he was another son Anders Olofsson who in turn was a son of Olof Olofsson. Olof Olofsson was another son Olof Hersesson ["Gamle Olof"]. Olof
2 CONC  Olofsson who had 2 sons and 9 daughters lived in his father's farm. The farm was owned in 1601 by Johan Bure and was located south of the river. According to Bureus, Bureå no. 6 was owned by Olof Olofsson's brother Anders Olofsso
2 CONC n.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Herse Andersson was married to Margareta Jönsdotter who was a sister of Erik Jönsson at Tuvan. The couple had children Barbro, who was married to Erik Olsson in Burträsk, Britta, who was married to Anund Andersson or Hångelsson i
2 CONC n Innervik, Kerstin, who was married to Staffan Andersson in Innervik, Cecilia (Cicill), who was married to Hans Andersson in Bureå, and Mariet,
2 CONT who was married to Nils Nilsson in Sjöbotten. According to Bureus, Herse Andersson is "said" to have had 2 sisters. One was married to Luleå and the other to Nolbyn in Lövångers parish. In 1543, Herse Andersson had 16 acres of ara
2 CONC ble land (2.6 hectares) and 20 loads of meadow. In 1546 year's land register states that of the area there were 2 acres of arable land (0.3 hectares) and 8 loads of meadow in Tuvan."
2 CONT
2 CONT DNA. Herse has no known sons, so his Y-DNA cannot be verified. But his father Anders Olofsson b. c. 1450 has his Y-DNA verified. See Bure family lines verified with DNA, "Släktlinjer inon Buresläkten som verifierats med hjälp av D
2 CONC NA" (2016), https://buredna.sjolunds.se/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/Burelinjer-161221.png
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan Bure's släktbok in autograph "Härse: i Bure" with wife "Mariet af Tuwan [of Tuvan]." Johan Bure's släktbok in autograph, fol. 195r[p. 169]. Also appears as  in copy X37, op. 83 (cited by Sikeborg).
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Andersson_Bure-2 (no sources)
2 CONT Ulf Lundström, "Bönder o Gårdar i Skellefteå 1539-1650," p. 396, Bureå 6, https://umu.diva-portal.org/smash/record.jsf?pid=diva2:729213&dswid=3108
2 CONT Urban Sikeborg, "Johan Bures släktbok" (USB) (2017), Person ID 1068.
2 CONT "Bureätten," part I, pp. 165-166, table 246-247
2 CONT .
2 CONT ---------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Herse Andersson ingick i Bureätten enligt Johan Bures släktbok. Han hade inga kända söner, så hans Y-DNA finns inte bevarat till nutid, och varken han eller hans far har kunnat DNA-verifieras. De tillhör inte de grenar i Bure-ätte
2 CONC n som har ifrågasatts med källkritisk metod. Herses farbror https://www.geni.com/people/Jon-Olofsson/6000000007220645211?through=6000000003463610943 har DNA-verifierats på nu levande ättlingar. Se [http://sjolunds.se/dna/Bure/DNA-
2 CONC verifierade-burelinjer-2018-fullsize.png DNA-verifierade Bure-ättlingar 2018].
2 CONT
2 CONT Källa: Peter Sjölund, Bure-DNA
2 CONT
2 CONT Herse Andersson var bonde på Bureå 6 mellan 1543-1549. År 1543 hade Herse Andersson 16 spannland åker (2,6 hektar) samt 20 lass äng. Enligt Bureus sägs Herse Andersson ha haft 2 systrar. Den ena gift till Luleå och den andre till 
2 CONC Nolbyn i Lövånger. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Källa: KF U.L. Skellefteå sn (1539-1650) s.396
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Född i Bure, Skellefteå lfs (Johan Bure). Bonde i Bure. Nämnd som bonde mellan 1543 och 1552 i Bure 6, Skellefteå. Ägare 1539 i Bure 6, Skellefteå lfs (Ulf Lundström). Ägare från 1543 till 1549 i Bure 6, Skellefteå lfs (Ulf Lundst
2 CONC röm). Gift med Margeta Jönsdotter. (Född i Tuvan, Skellefteå lfs.) Far: Jöns.
2 CONT --------------------
